---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import andrea from '../content/imgs/andrea.webp';
---

<section class="h-card">
    <Image class="u-photo" src={andrea} alt="Profile picture" width="150" />
    <p>Hi! I'm <a href="https://anprivitera.com" class="p-name u-url u-uid" rel="me">Andrea Privitera</a> (<span class="p-pronoun">he</span>/<span class="p-pronoun">him</span>), and this is my little corner of the web.</p>
    <p class="p-note">Here I write about media, politics, and tech (particularly selfhosting and the IndieWeb).</p>
    <p>You can find me also on <a href="https://github.com/anprivitera" rel="me">GitHub</a>.</p>
</section>